{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓劇《再婚皇后》男星朱智勛與合作16年的Blitzway事務所約滿後，決定離巢自立門戶，準備與一直合作的經紀事務長一同成立個人公司。朱智勛現時仍持有Blitzway約5.73%的股份，Blitzway前日發聲明表示尊重並支持朱智勛正在籌備個人公司的決定，也衷心祝願他未來一切順利。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:29:32.411189+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T02:58:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T19:12:42.555578+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:22:54.361514+00:00","content_hash":"d05c617658e9b944b0c7fb59fcbf022114e25ddee6e31226fdb24a71b5fcb9f7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:29:32.411189+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}